/* 经典尊贵曜金恒定收银台大按键 (与名烟品鉴“我抽一支”统一顶级大厂香槟金琉璃美学，无生硬白边) */
.checkout-cta-btn {
  width: 276rpx;
  min-width: 276rpx;
  max-width: 276rpx;
  height: 84rpx;
  flex-shrink: 0;
  border-radius: 999rpx;
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, #fef3c7 0%, #fde68a 22%, #f59e0b 68%, #d97706 100%);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
  border: none;
  box-shadow:
    0 10rpx 28rpx rgba(217, 119, 6, 0.42),
    0 2rpx 8rpx rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.35),
    0 0 20rpx rgba(253, 230, 138, 0.40),
    inset 0 2rpx 3rpx rgba(254, 240, 138, 0.65),
    inset 0 -2.5rpx 5rpx rgba(180, 83, 9, 0.40);
  padding: 0;
  transition: transform 0.15s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1), opacity 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
}

.checkout-cta-btn:active {
  transform: scale(0.96);
  box-shadow:
    0 4rpx 14rpx rgba(217, 119, 6, 0.38),
    inset 0 2rpx 3rpx rgba(254, 240, 138, 0.7);
}

.checkout-cta-btn::after {
  display: none;
}

.checkout-cta-btn.btn-disabled {
  opacity: 0.48;
  filter: grayscale(0.65);
  box-shadow: 0 4rpx 12rpx rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) !important;
}

.checkout-cta-btn.btn-disabled .btn-shine-sweep {
  display: none;
}

.checkout-cta-btn.btn-ios-free {
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, #fef3c7 0%, #fde68a 22%, #f59e0b 68%, #d97706 100%);
  border: none;
  box-shadow:
    0 10rpx 28rpx rgba(217, 119, 6, 0.42),
    0 2rpx 8rpx rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.35),
    0 0 20rpx rgba(253, 230, 138, 0.40),
    inset 0 2rpx 3rpx rgba(254, 240, 138, 0.65),
    inset 0 -2.5rpx 5rpx rgba(180, 83, 9, 0.40);
}

/* 腾讯游戏级收银台 CTA 尊贵耀目光刃扫光 (Luminous Sweeping Light Blade) */
.btn-shine-sweep {
  position: absolute;
  top: -60%;
  left: -80rpx;
  width: 70rpx;
  height: 220%;
  pointer-events: none;
  background: linear-gradient(
    90deg,
    rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) 0%,
    rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25) 25%,
    rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.90) 50%,
    rgba(254, 240, 138, 0.85) 65%,
    rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) 100%
  );
  transform: rotate(26deg);
  animation: ctaBtnSweep 3.2s cubic-bezier(0.25, 1, 0.5, 1) infinite;
  z-index: 1;
}

@keyframes ctaBtnSweep {
  0% {
    transform: translateX(-40rpx) rotate(26deg);
    opacity: 0;
  }
  6% {
    opacity: 1;
  }
  28% {
    transform: translateX(420rpx) rotate(26deg);
    opacity: 1;
  }
  32%, 100% {
    transform: translateX(420rpx) rotate(26deg);
    opacity: 0;
  }
}

.btn-cta-text {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 2;
  font-size: 30rpx;
  font-weight: 900;
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, #451a03 0%, #78350f 55%, #451a03 100%);
  -webkit-background-clip: text;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  color: #451a03;
  letter-spacing: 2.5rpx;
  white-space: nowrap;
  filter: drop-shadow(0 1rpx 1rpx rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.65));
}

